	(text "AD9084 Apollo MxFE, Rev D. 4x 12-bit ADC to 20 GSPS, 4x 16-bit DAC to 28 GSPS, analog bandwidth to 18 GHz. This board uses 2T2R: ADC0/ADC2 are the DC-coupled HF inputs, ADC1/ADC3 the balun MW inputs, DAC0/DAC1 the two TX channels. DAC2 is the internal cal tone, DAC3 is terminated. JESD204C lanes are global nets JESD_ADC_P0..15 / N and JESD_DAC_P0..15 / N. 48 physical lanes exist on the BGA; 16 each direction are routed, the rest are parked per UG-2300. Sub-rail currents below are the datasheet's low-rate illustration and are NOT the 20 GSPS budget. Budget 40 W for the MxFE and follow UG-2300 for decoupling and sequence."
		(at 20.00 18.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)))
		(uuid "ed7674ba-f65b-588b-9837-1ec3292d8ebd")
	)
